<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1115 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1115 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh loins not fully established; butts not tested; sknd. hams 17-20 lbs steady, 20-26 lbs $4.00 lower; sdls. bellies steady; lean trimmings $1.00-3.00 lower.</p>
<p>Trading slow, with light demand and mostly moderate offerings. -USDA</p>
